Package: librsvg2-2
Version: @DEB_LIBRSVG_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://wiki.gnome.org/Projects/LibRsvg
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libgdk-pixbuf-2.0-0, libcairo2, libcairo-gobject2, libpango-1.0-0, libfreetype6, libharfbuzz0b, libxml2
Description: SVG rendering library
 librsvg renders non-animated SVG images to Cairo surfaces.
 .
 This package contains the runtime library used by the GdkPixbuf SVG loader
 and applications that link directly against librsvg.
